<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Zheng Maisi</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">d. 909</span> · <a href="/centuries/9th-century">9th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Zheng Maisi was a minister of Nanzhao, descended from a Tang official captured by the kingdom. In 902 he massacred the Meng royal family and proclaimed the kingdom of Da Changhe, centred on the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/lake-erhai">Erhai</a> basin of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/yunnan">Yunnan</a>. He ruled until his death in 909, and his descendants held the throne until 928.</p></div>
